                                "sense_id": "8dead9df-b833-3a1b-9a91-70287d7be486",
                                "text": "\"So that then begins a sort of rethinking of my idea of criminology,\" Weisburd said. \"Like most other people, my studies were about people. I said, maybe we ought to be more concerned with places.\""
